\ Forth 2012 extensions
CR .( Loading Forth2012 extensions... )
330 CONSTANT WORDSET_STRING     \ string
360 CONSTANT WORDSET_CORE_EXT     \ load core-ext
390 CONSTANT WORDSET_DOUBLE_EXT     \ load double-ext numbers
420 CONSTANT WORDSET_TOOLS_EXT     \ load tools-ext
450 CONSTANT WORDSET_FACILITY_EXT     \ load facility-ext
480 CONSTANT WORDSET_STRING_EXT     \ load string-ext
510 CONSTANT WORDSET_MEMORY     \ load memory
540 CONSTANT WORDSET_SEARCHORDER     \ search order
570 CONSTANT WORDSET_FILEACCESS     \ file access
600 CONSTANT WORDSET_LOCALS     \ load locals

